{"fps": 30, "frames": 1730, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 174, "text": "In nineteen twenty-nine, Wall Street sold boxes of stocks for more than what's inside.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 0, "e": 3}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 5, "e": 16}, {"w": "twenty-nine,", "f": 18, "e": 47}, {"w": "Wall", "f": 50, "e": 54}, {"w": "Street", "f": 56, "e": 63}, {"w": "sold", "f": 65, "e": 72}, {"w": "boxes", "f": 74, "e": 86}, {"w": "of", "f": 88, "e": 90}, {"w": "stocks", "f": 92, "e": 104}, {"w": "for", "f": 106, "e": 110}, {"w": "more", "f": 115, "e": 119}, {"w": "than", "f": 122, "e": 126}, {"w": "what's", "f": 128, "e": 132}, {"w": "inside.", "f": 133, "e": 162}]}, {"a": 174, "b": 377, "text": "December nineteen twenty-eight. Goldman Sachs opens a trust, a company that only owns other shares.", "words": [{"w": "December", "f": 176, "e": 189}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 192, "e": 205}, {"w": "twenty-eight.", "f": 210, "e": 230}, {"w": "Goldman", "f": 239, "e": 250}, {"w": "Sachs", "f": 252, "e": 261}, {"w": "opens", "f": 264, "e": 273}, {"w": "a", "f": 274, "e": 276}, {"w": "trust,", "f": 277, "e": 297}, {"w": "a", "f": 299, "e": 300}, {"w": "company", "f": 302, "e": 311}, {"w": "that", "f": 314, "e": 318}, {"w": "only", "f": 320, "e": 327}, {"w": "owns", "f": 329, "e": 336}, {"w": "other", "f": 340, "e": 345}, {"w": "shares.", "f": 349, "e": 371}]}, {"a": 377, "b": 489, "text": "You pay a hundred and four dollars for about a hundred dollars of stocks.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 379, "e": 383}, {"w": "pay", "f": 385, "e": 388}, {"w": "a", "f": 389, "e": 390}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 392, "e": 399}, {"w": "and", "f": 401, "e": 403}, {"w": "four", "f": 406, "e": 408}, {"w": "dollars", "f": 410, "e": 421}, {"w": "for", "f": 424, "e": 426}, {"w": "about", "f": 428, "e": 435}, {"w": "a", "f": 437, "e": 439}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 441, "e": 446}, {"w": "dollars", "f": 448, "e": 457}, {"w": "of", "f": 460, "e": 461}, {"w": "stocks.", "f": 462, "e": 485}]}, {"a": 489, "b": 579, "text": "Within wee